@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60
hide empty members
skinparam titleFontSize 24
skinparam legendFontSize 16
title CL07 - Tài khoản và hợp đồng lưu xác minh
caption Thiết kế đề xuất; chưa có code. D02 gửi thư sau commit là đề xuất; không coi gửi thư là đã xác minh
top to bottom direction
class Account <<aggregate root>> #F0F6ED {
  - id: AccountId
  - email: EmailAddress
  - passwordHash: SecretHash [0..1]
  - emailVerified: boolean
  - status: AccountStatus
  - roles: RoleSet
  --
  + verifyEmail(proof: VerifiedEmailProof): void
  + lock(): void
  + unlock(): void
}
class VerificationToken <<entity>> #F0F6ED {
  - accountId: AccountId
  - tokenHash: SecretHash
  - expiresAt: Instant
  - consumed: boolean
  --
  + consume(now: Instant): VerifiedEmailProof
}
class ExternalIdentityLink <<entity>> #F0F6ED {
  - provider: Provider
  - subject: String
  - accountId: AccountId
}
class Session <<entity>> #F0F6ED {
  - idHash: SecretHash
  - accountId: AccountId
  - active: boolean
  --
  + revoke(): void
}
class MailJob <<entity / proposed>> #F0F6ED {
  - id: MailJobId
  - accountId: AccountId
  - state: SendState
  - attempts: int
  --
  + recordAttempt(result: MailSendResult): void
}
interface AccountPort <<interface>> #DCEEFF {
  + findByEmail(email: EmailAddress): AccountResult
  + saveVerified(account: Account, token: VerificationToken): SaveResult
  + createPending(account: Account, token: VerificationToken, job: MailJob): SaveResult
}
interface MailJobPort <<interface>> #DCEEFF {
  + nextPending(): MailJobResult
  + saveAttempt(job: MailJob): SaveResult
}
class PostgresIdentityAdapter <<adapter>> #EEF0F4 {
  + findByEmail(email: EmailAddress): AccountResult
  + saveVerified(account: Account, token: VerificationToken): SaveResult
  + createPending(account: Account, token: VerificationToken, job: MailJob): SaveResult
  + nextPending(): MailJobResult
  + saveAttempt(job: MailJob): SaveResult
}
VerificationToken --> Account : 0..* — 1
ExternalIdentityLink --> Account : 0..* — 1
Session --> Account : 0..* — 1
MailJob --> Account : 0..* — 1
AccountPort ..> Account : hợp đồng nguyên tử
MailJobPort ..> MailJob : gửi sau commit
PostgresIdentityAdapter ..|> AccountPort
PostgresIdentityAdapter ..|> MailJobPort
legend bottom left
  Nét đứt, mũi tên thường: dependency.
  Nét đứt, tam giác rỗng: realization (implements).
  Nét liền, mũi tên thường: association có hướng.
  Thoi đặc ở đầu chứa: composition.
  Kiểu dữ liệu phụ: xem HOP_DONG_DU_LIEU.md.
  Thiết kế dự kiến; chưa có mã ứng dụng.
endlegend
@enduml
